    "peak_population": 4,
    "pause_on_complete": false,
    "hint_zh": "前 18 秒代谢减半；请游向黄绿营养颗粒重叠吞噬，繁殖可提高种群峰值。",
    "hint_en": "Metabolism is halved for the first 18s — swim into gold nutrients to feed and breed for peak population.",
    "victory_title_zh": "莲池入门 · 通关",
    "victory_title_en": "Pond Tutorial · Complete",
    "victory_banner_zh": "存活与繁殖目标已达成，欢迎来到 PVAEC · 细胞演化 演示。",
    "victory_banner_en": "Survival and breeding goals met — welcome to the Main World SR demo.",
    "extinction_title_zh": "细胞灭绝",
    "extinction_title_en": "Extinction",
    "extinction_banner_zh": "所有细胞已消亡，可调整营养或代谢参数后重试。",
    "extinction_banner_en": "All cells are gone — tweak nutrients or metabolism and try again."
  },
